### What are common interview follow-up questions?

- How do you size each pool? Based on expected throughput and IO latency per downstream. Formula: `maxConcurrent = throughput x latency`.
- What is the difference between thread pool bulkhead and semaphore bulkhead? Thread pool isolates execution; semaphore limits concurrency without allocating threads.
- Should every microservice call have its own pool? Yes, at least for critical downstream dependencies.
